-- FIX LOG (issues repaired during remediation)
-- [KEEP] SNZ-01 line 18: template tag `<% ctx.env.S_vw6122_CompareLinksRecordsWithTeradata_Current_date %>` preserved verbatim (inside TO_DATE(...,'DDMONYY'))
-- [DEF-07] line 13: subquery alias `IN_DEP_GMTFLIGHT_FLIGHT_DT` -> `IN_DEP_FLIGHT_DT` (find/replace drift; outer WHERE line 31 and NOT EXISTS guard line 38 already use IN_DEP_FLIGHT_DT, so the alias was the outlier). TODO(SME): confirm alias rename matches staging column grain.
